<title>UK: BA H1 passenger yield up 4.1 percent.</title>
<headline>BA H1 passenger yield up 4.1 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Airways Plc said on Monday its scheduled passenger yield -- the average fare paid per passenger for every kilometre flown -- rose 4.1 percent to 6.54 pence in the six months to end-September.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
